<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-QBE buys U.K. reinsurer for A$70 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-QBE buys U.K. reinsurer for A$70 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>QBE Insurance Ltd said on Friday it was to buy the U.K. reinsurance operations of Allstate Insurance Co for A$70 million.</p>
</text>
